ithin a beautiful landscape and with an excellent soundtrack.\r\n\r\n<b>Warning: This film contains sequences with flashing or flickering lights that may affect individuals with photosensitivity. Viewer discretion is advised.</b></div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"film-times\">\n                                    \n                                        \n\n\n\n  \n\n<a class=\"performance-button button sm  \" data-perf-id=\"16258\" data-filters=\"\" data-start-time=\"2026-04-04T18:15:00\" href=\"/bookings/16258/\">\n    18:15\n    \n        <span class=\"sold-out\" style=\"display:none;\">sold out</span>\n        <span class=\"last-few\" style=\"display:none;\">(last few seats)</span>\n        \n        \n    \n    \n        <span class=\"screen\">S2</span>\n    \n</a>\n\n                                    \n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        \n                        \n                        <div class=\"programme-tile tile slim\" data-prog-id=\"107463\" data-filters=\"audio-described\">\n                            <div class=\"slim-table\">\n                                <div class=\"tile-img\">\n                                    \n\n<div class=\"bbfc\">\n    <img src=\"/static/images/BBFC_15.png\" alt=\"BBFC 15\">\n</div>\n\n\n                                    <a href=\"/programme/107463/sirat/\">\n                                        \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<div class=\" responsive-image-wrapper programme-image-wrapper\" style=\"padding-bottom: 150.0%;\">\n\n\n    \n    <picture>\n        <source srcset=\"/optimised-images/c_crop,ar_128:192/w_128,h_192,f_webp,q_auto/https://thecastlecinema.com/_media/sirat-poster.jpg, /optimised-images/c_crop,ar_128:192/w_128,h_192,f_webp,q_auto/https://thecastlecinema.com/images/default-poster.jpg\" type=\"image/webp\">\n        <source srcset=\"/optimised-images/c_cr